summary: 'A five-agent adversarial panel (architect, Aegis/security, Judge/reviewer, Probe/tester, Jinx/advocate — the last dispatched manually because the orchestrator bug T-2026-08-11-007 drops her) audited the "WARPLINE FLIGHT VERSION IS READY" checkpoint, each tasked to FALSIFY not confirm. Unanimous, independently-converged verdict: NOT READY as "true source control for the agentic age"; READY-WITH-CAVEATS only as a supervised, git-backed, mirror-mode field trial operated by its own author. Two agents reproduced a false CLEAN by hand on the canonical invariant case. This is the opening state for the session''s work toward the true goal.'
